1. FONTS
--------

Founders Grotesk (Klim Type Foundry) — PROPRIETARY, NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY

Éclaire sets its event tags in Founders Grotesk X-Condensed, which is
licensed commercially from Klim Type Foundry and is NOT redistributable
under the AGPL or any other open-source license. The font file is therefore
kept in a separate private repository, mounted as a git submodule at:

    src/assets/fonts/

Public clones cannot fetch that submodule, and nothing is lost by that: the
build detects the font's absence and simply does not register the family
(see astro.config.mjs), so Éclaire builds and runs normally, with the event
tags falling back to Neue Haas Grotesk Display. To reproduce the original
typography you must hold your own Klim Type Foundry license.

Neue Haas Grotesk Display — served at runtime through Adobe Fonts
(configured in astro.config.mjs via fontProviders.adobe), subject to Adobe's
terms of service. Not redistributed in this repository, and not covered by
the AGPL grant.

Inter Tight — served through Fontsource under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.


