4. MAP DATA AND TILES
---------------------

Éclaire displays map tiles from Stadia Maps, OpenMapTiles and CARTO, built
on OpenStreetMap data. Attribution is rendered in the application (see
src/components/Map.astro). OpenStreetMap data is licensed under the Open
Database License (ODbL). Map tiles and data are obtained from their
providers under those providers' terms and are not covered by the AGPL
grant.
